    "text": "The term independent of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, is equal to ___."
  },
